Package: KpVirTracer
Type: Package
Title: Klebsiella pneumoniae Virulence Tracing Pipeline
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "KpVirTracer",
      family = "Team",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "maintainer@example.org"
    )
  )
Description: A command-line oriented R pipeline for Klebsiella pneumoniae
    whole-genome assembly analysis. It integrates Kleborate, MOB-suite,
    BLAST, ANI, annotation, synteny, and HGT classification to provide
    reproducible sample-level and pair-level reports.
